  m_text: "Completing any type of Diamond Progression triggers the Progression Pick
    Bonus.\nThere is 30 elements in 6 columns.\nPlayer can pick any of 5 emelents
    on active column and move onto the next column.\nFrom the element, one of the
    followings can be won:\n   - Coin Prize\n   - Coin Prize + Collectible\nWinning
    at least one Collectible throughout the columns allows player to re-play the non-collectible
    won columns.\nCollecting 6 Collectibles awards Top Prize. "
